meta {
  name: 02_AccessInformationFlags
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  Scenario: Access information is only returned when it is asked for

    Given the daily leader asks for every kind of access information
    Then roles, access packages, resources and instances are all populated
    When no access information is asked for
    Then all four collections are empty on every party
    And the same holds when no query parameters are given at all
    And each flag populates only its own collection
}
